 to cut  her hair and wear men's clothes if he  wins the fight starts and goes on for  quite a while however it is evident that  ricardo is way more skilled than shannon  suddenly he catches her off guard and  punches her in the stomach the pain  almost causes shannon to pass out after  the punch she can hardly get up and is  defeated in a single kick ricardo laughs  at her and hands her a pair of scissors  accepting her defeat shannon cuts her  hair the next day she goes to school  with short hair and is made fun of by  everyone when she enters the class  ricardo calls her a man making her  angrier than she already is when he  doesn't stop calling her names she  attacks him in the middle of the class  they have to be separated by the teacher  before a fight breaks out shannon is  then taken to the principal's office he  calls danny to tell him about his  daughter's shenanigans danny apologizes  for the inconvenience claiming that she  is aggressive because he hasn't been a  good father to her he also begs the  principal to let her free this time when  shannon goes to pick up lunch from the  cafeteria that day some girls block her  they have also joined hands with ricardo  to trouble her around the school  shannon's friend yells at everyone for  supporting a bully but they ignore her  not wanting to cause a scene shannon  walks away without her lunch she  reminisces about her mother who was the  reason she took interest in kung fu  while most mothers dressed their  daughters in princess dresses shannon's  mother made her train from a very young  age she believed that kung fu needed  girls like shannon as much as shannon  needed kung fu that night danny calls  her and asks her to come home for the  weekend since she hasn't been home in 3  months shannon is reluctant but she  agrees to visit him anyway after the  call with his daughter dany also calls  an investor and asks him to come over to  test his new game he has created a  virtual game where one has to fight in 